          "content_blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Furosemide can cause a significant decrease in placental intervillous blood flow. Diuretics are contraindicated with contracted IV volume. Caution must be exercised if diuretic therapy is implemented.",
